  "name": "Cranberry Amaretto Bakewell Tart",
  "subtitle": "A crisp almond pastry tart with cranberry filling and citrus frangipane",
  "description": "A buttery almond tart layered with cranberry compote and orange-scented frangipane, finished with a simple amaretto glaze.",
